TITLE Equilibrium with minerals at 100C, pH 3

SOLUTION 1
    temp    100
    pH      3.0
    units   mol/L
    water   1.0

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica          0.0  10.0
    Kaolinite       0.0  10.0
    Dolomite        0.0  10.0
    Epsomite        0.0  10.0
    Fe(OH)3(a)      0.0  10.0
    Halite          0.0  10.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file           mirabilite_sim.out
    -reset          false
    -si             Mirabilite

END
